            "question": "What if I forget my BCA Credit Card PIN?",
            "answer": "You can reactivate your BCA Credit Card PIN through myBCA, BCA mobile, a BCA ATM, or bca.co.id/creditcard under e-Statement & PIN Activation."
          },
          {
            "question": "What should I do if my BCA Credit Card is lost or stolen?",
            "answer": "Block the card immediately through myBCA, BCA mobile, or Halo BCA at 1500888. A card blocked due to loss or theft needs to be replaced before it can be used again."
          },
          {
            "question": "How do I pay my BCA Credit Card bill?",
            "answer": "In myBCA, choose Pay & Top Up, then Credit Card & Paylater. Select the card and funding source, enter the payment amount, review the details, then confirm with your PIN."
          }
        ]
      }
